      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A patient with idiopathic hypertrophic subaortic stenosis and normal coronary arteries, with dynamic electrocardiographic changes resembling acute myocardial ischemia, is presented. A definite association between the electrocardiographic changes and the idiopathic hypertrophic subaortic stenosis cannot be absolutely confirmed; however, the findings demonstrate the broad spectrum of electrocardiographic presentation in this disease."},
